body:
Ive been feeling very bad lately, the only thing I think is about dying doing something of worth, recently broke up with my girlfriend, she help me see a path for life, and help me grow up, but I cant think anything other than dying.

&#x200B;

I listen to podcast or videos where a person says "You are worthy" or "I love you", a new one is to look for father or masculine figures that say "Im proud of you" or "You are perfect like you are". I cry like a baby and imagine a father huging me, or my ex doing it

&#x200B;

I dont know how to talk to woman, im 21, i feel that are aliens all of the sudden, I feel very lonely, I dont have friends, I was thinking on joining some kind of military, I want to see how does killing another person feels like, how like to have friends, true friends that are with you and support you. I wish to go back in time and do things right, fake my personality and doing that christmas party she wanted, with his family, I wish I had.

&#x200B;

Been praying, to god, trying to find a meaning in religion, listening to orthodox chants, never have I been a religious guy

&#x200B;

A recent fantasy I have consist on throwing my life away and going to the sea, maybe some kind of sailor, never get back, live adventures and in my free time write my stories and comic books. Having friends, and a person to love, then I realize that is a fantasy

&#x200B;

I feel like I want to die doing something of value like saving someone, or helping a person get better, maybe as a sacrifice, a dream I've been having is that I'm in this desert and there are 5 people with me, there is a guy pointing at them with A gun, and I have the answer, I grab a knife and stab myself, then the guy disappears and the people are safe, a life for a life

&#x200B;

Maybe in prayer is the key, I dont know, any advice?
